guide forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde
title Call of Earth (Horde)
category Class
class Shaman
folder Shaman
faction Horde
levels 4-5
zone Durotar
keywords Earth Totem, Stoneskin Totem, Earth Sapta, Call of Earth, Canaga Earthcaller, Seer Ravenfeather, Windshaper Boro, Spirit Rock, Kodo Rock, Rise of Spirits, Minor Manifestation of Earth, Felstalker Hoof, Ritual Salve, Signet of Akir, Rough Quartz, Shaman, class quest, totem
reward item 5175
reward spell 8071 "Stoneskin Totem"
why Your Earth Totem: without it no earth totem can be cast. Stoneskin Totem comes with it at level 4.

# Call of Earth at level 4, the first shaman totem quest, one start per home:
# - Orcs and Trolls (Valley of Trials): Canaga Earthcaller (1516: two
#   Felstalker Hooves) -> Spirit Rock up the Hidden Path (1517) -> Canaga
#   (1518).
# - Tauren (Camp Narache): Seer Ravenfeather (1519: two Ritual Salves from
#   the Bristleback Shamans) -> Kodo Rock east of the camp (1520) -> the Seer
#   (1521).
# - Skyborne (Zephras Isle): Windshaper Boro in Thendal Village (92466: a
#   Signet of Akir from the Al'Aketh) -> the Rise of Spirits north-east of the
#   village (92467) -> Boro (92468).
# The three openers exclude one another (quests.json `excl`). Each middle
# quest hands you an Earth Sapta: it works only beside the shrine stone, where
# it lets you see the Minor Manifestation of Earth. Earth Sapta (1463 Canaga,
# 1462 the Seer) replaces a lost one while the shrine quest is open.
# Rewards (quests.json): the Earth Totem (5175) on 1518 and 1521; Forever's
# quest data lists none for 92468, the Skyborne leveling guide's hand-in gives
# the same totem and spell. Stoneskin Totem: the spell the chain unlocks
# (classrewards chain reward).
# Earth Sapta 1463 and 1462 are offered "while on quest" 1517 / 1520
# (PrevQuestID -1517 and -1520 in both world databases): the data read that as
# "turned in" until forever-db/corrections/quests.json dropped it; the steps
# ask for the quest to be in the log, as the server does.
# Drops and timers from Forever's quest notes: Felstalker Hoof and Ritual Salve
# 80% per kill; 16 Felstalkers (3 min 20 s respawn), Bristleback Shamans
# 4 min 10 s. The Signet of Akir has no drop rate in the data.
# The leveling guides carry this chain inline (orc-troll/01-durotar,
# tauren/01-mulgore, horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle): this guide is for
# shamans off our route or coming back for it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orcs and Trolls: Valley of Trials

step Canaga Earthcaller
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Durotar
  tip Canaga Earthcaller stands just outside the Den, the cave in the middle of the Valley of Trials. The quest opens at level 4.
  level 4
  accept 1516                                 -- Canaga Earthcaller

step Felstalker Hooves
  only Orc,Troll
  tip Felstalkers (level 3-4) prowl the slope below the Burning Blade Coven, the cave in the north of the valley, and just inside its mouth among the Vile Familiars. Nearly every Felstalker drops a hoof (four kills in five); they respawn in a little over three minutes.
  collect 6640 x2 quest 1516.1                -- Felstalker Hoof

step Canaga Earthcaller
  only Orc,Troll
  tip Back to Canaga outside the Den. She hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet.
  turnin 1516                                 -- Canaga Earthcaller
  accept 1517

step Lost the Earth Sapta?
  only Orc,Troll
  when onquest 1517
  when !has 6635
  tip Only if the Earth Sapta is gone from your bags (drunk away from the rock, or sold): Canaga gives you another.
  turnin 1463 direct                          -- Canaga Earthcaller: a new Earth Sapta

step Spirit Rock
  only Orc,Troll
  tip Spirit Rock sits on a ledge in the hills just south of the Den. The Hidden Path up starts at the foot of the hills south-west of the Den, between two idle peons; it climbs south-west into the hills, then bends back east to the rock. Stand right beside the stone and drink the Earth Sapta: the Minor Manifestation of Earth appears for a short while, so speak to it at once (walk almost under it if it does not answer). Coming back, you can drop down the ledge towards the Den instead of walking the path.
  use 6635 @44.1,76.4                         -- Earth Sapta, beside Spirit Rock
  turnin 1517                                 -- Minor Manifestation of Earth
  accept 1518                                 -- it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it

step Canaga Earthcaller
  only Orc,Troll
  tip Bring the Rough Quartz back to Canaga outside the Den. Keep the Earth Totem she gives you in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it.
  turnin 1518 reward 5175                     -- Canaga Earthcaller: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem
  train class                                 -- the level 4 shaman spells

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren: Camp Narache

step Seer Ravenfeather
  only Tauren
  zone Mulgore
  tip Seer Ravenfeather stands in Camp Narache. She may show no quest mark over her head: speak to her anyway. The quest opens at level 4.
  level 4
  accept 1519                                 -- Seer Ravenfeather

step Ritual Salve
  only Tauren
  tip The Bristleback Shamans (level 3-4) stand among the quilboar huts of Brambleblade Ravine, east of the camp, and throw the odd Lightning Bolt. Four kills in five drop a salve; they respawn in about four minutes.
  collect 6634 x2 quest 1519.1                -- Ritual Salve

step Seer Ravenfeather
  only Tauren
  tip Back to the Seer in Camp Narache. She hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet.
  turnin 1519                                 -- Seer Ravenfeather
  accept 1520

step Lost the Earth Sapta?
  only Tauren
  when onquest 1520
  when !has 6635
  tip Only if the Earth Sapta is gone from your bags: the Seer gives you another.
  turnin 1462 direct                          -- Seer Ravenfeather: a new Earth Sapta

step Kodo Rock
  only Tauren
  tip Kodo Rock is a small pillar on a low mound due east of Greatmother Hawkwind's well, east of the camp; it only shows from about fifteen yards away, and hostile boars graze around it. Stand beside it and drink the Earth Sapta, then speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth before it fades (drink again if it does).
  use 6635 @52.0,80.1                         -- Earth Sapta, beside Kodo Rock
  turnin 1520                                 -- Minor Manifestation of Earth
  accept 1521                                 -- it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it

step Seer Ravenfeather
  only Tauren
  tip Bring the Rough Quartz back to the Seer. Keep the Earth Totem in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it.
  turnin 1521 reward 5175                     -- Seer Ravenfeather: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem
  train class                                 -- the level 4 shaman spells

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skyborne: Zephras Isle

step Windshaper Boro
  only Skyborne
  zone Zephras Isle
  tip Windshaper Boro, the shaman trainer, stands in Thendal Village. The quest opens at level 3.
  level 3
  accept 92466                                -- Windshaper Boro

step Signet of Akir
  only Skyborne
  tip Any Al'Aketh cultist can carry the Signet of Akir: the Converts (level 2-3) around the standing stones just east of the village, or the Brutes and Neophytes (level 4) in the camp beyond Hanaa Nightwind, south-west of the village. Keep killing until one drops it.
  collect 251924 quest 92466.1                -- Signet of Akir

step Windshaper Boro
  only Skyborne
  tip Back to Boro in Thendal Village. He hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet.
  turnin 92466                                -- Windshaper Boro
  accept 92467

step The Rise of Spirits
  only Skyborne
  tip The Rise of Spirits is the hilltop shrine north-east of Boro: the path up starts on the hill just above the clearing where the flies were. Drink the Earth Sapta beside the shrine and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth before it fades.
  use 6635 @49.7,23.8                         -- Earth Sapta, beside the shrine
  turnin 92467                                -- Minor Manifestation of Earth
  accept 92468                                -- it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it

step Windshaper Boro
  only Skyborne
  tip Bring the Rough Quartz back to Boro. Keep the Earth Totem in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it.
  turnin 92468                                -- Windshaper Boro: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem
  train class
